= Ludwig Kaas


Kaas is the leader of the Papal delegation to Germany, with his ties to the Papacy going far back.

- @catholics_kaas
- @concordat_kaas
- @national_concordat_kaas
- @negotiate_concordat_kaas
- @root: Return to main

@catholics_kaas
title: Campaign among Catholics
subtitle: Kaas can help organize Catholics.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government: The <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; catholics_z += 6*(1-dissent); catholics += 2

We have increasesd our campaigning among Catholics.


@concordat_kaas
title: Sign the Prussian Concordat
subtitle: Kaas' ties to the Papacy helps swiften the negotiations.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if far_right_prussia or spd_majority_prussia or left_front_prussia or social_liberal_prussia: The <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span> is not in the Prussian goverment. ?]
choose-if: in_weimar_coalition_prussia or in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia or in_grand_coalition_prussia or in_center_right_coalition_prussia and spd_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; prussian_concordat = 1; catholics_z += 5*(1-dissent); catholics += 5; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

We have signed a Concordat between the Free State of Prussia and the Roman Catholic Church, guaranteeing religious freedom for Catholics in Prussia. This sets the stage for the negotiation of a national Concordat covering all of Germany.

@national_concordat_kaas
title: Sign a Concordat between Germany and the Vatican
title: The Papacy is willing.
view-if: reichskonkordat_progress >= 4 and reichskonkordat = 0
on-arrival: reichskonkordat = 1; catholics_z += 8*(1-dissent); catholics += 6; foreign_goal_spd_peoples += 1; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5; dvp_relation -= 2; ddp_relation -= 2; lvp_relation -= 1.5
achievement: reichskonkordat

We have successfully signed a Concordat between Germany and the Roman Catholic Church! This treaty defines a formal relationship between the Church and the German state, guaranteeing freedom of worship for Catholics, and the right of the church to appoint their own clergy. This is a moment of celebration within our party, bolstering our support and pleasing dissenting voices.

@negotiate_concordat_kaas
title: Negotiate a Concordat covering all of Germany
subtitle: Kaas' ties to the Papacy helps swiften the negotiations.
view-if: reichskonkordat = 0 and reichskonkordat_progress < 4
on-arrival: reichskonkordat_progress += 2; reichskonkordat_progress -= 1 if abortion_rights; reichskonkordat_progress -= 1 if family_law; z_relation += 3*(1-dissent); dvp_relation -= 1; ddp_relation -= 2; ddp_cohesion -= 0.25; lvp_relation -= 1; foreign_goal_spd_peoples += 1

The Roman Catholic Church is interested in furthering relations with the German Republic, seeing us as preferable to the old anti-Catholic policies of the Empire. We are working towards the signing of a Concordat, an agreement between the Vatican and the Republic that formally recognizes the Church's rights and interests in the country. The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] is especially interested in making this agreement. The liberal parties are against this idea.
[? if family_law : Our liberalized divorce policies make it difficult to build relations with the Vatican. ?] [? if abortion : Our legalization of abortion make it difficult to connect with the Church. ?] Kaas uses his connections to speed up negotiations.
